WEBVTT

00:03:28.479 --> 00:03:31.411
Keling miyaga qaraylik.

00:03:31.411 --> 00:03:36.187
Bu miya zhamiyat olimshunosi tomonidan

00:03:36.187 --> 00:03:38.671
bizga berilgan, ular buning

00:03:38.671 --> 00:03:41.786
nima ekanligini bilmabdi

00:03:41.786 --> 00:03:43.811
har holda qanday ishlatishni

00:03:43.811 --> 00:03:46.406
( kulgi)

00:03:46.406 --> 00:03:48.339
Uzr.

00:03:48.339 --> 00:03:51.916
Va men uni olib turdim. Ular payqamadi ham. mayli.

00:03:51.916 --> 00:03:54.731
( kulgi)

00:03:54.731 --> 00:03:57.649
Shunday demoqchimanki, uyqu paytida

00:03:57.649 --> 00:03:59.619
miya hech to'xtamaydi.

00:03:59.619 --> 00:04:01.947
Aslida, miyaning ba'zi qismlari uyquda yanada ko'proq ishlaydi